    answer: '(1) 分别求导：\\(\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2}\\)，\\(\\frac{dy}{dt}=\\frac{1}{1+t^2}\\)。故\n\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{\\frac{dy}{dt}}{\\frac{dx}{dt}}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{1+t^2}}{\\frac{2t}{1+t^2}}=\\frac{1}{2t} \\]\n(2) 对一阶导再对 \\(x\\) 求导，务必再除以一次 \\(\\frac{dx}{dt}\\)：\n\\[ \\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{1}{2t}\\right)}{\\frac{dx}{dt}}=\\frac{-\\frac{1}{2t^2}}{\\frac{2t}{1+t^2}}=-\\frac{1+t^2}{4t^3} \\]\n(3) 代入 \\(t=1\\)：\\(\\left.\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}\\right|_{t=1}=-\\frac{1+1}{4\\cdot 1}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\)。',
